@startuml process-egm-planning
title Planning with the Elephant-Goldfish Model
actor Developer
participant "Elephant\n(long-context session)" as E
participant "Goldfish\n(stateless reviewer)" as G
database "docs/plans/NN-title.md" as D

== Brainstorm (no code) ==
Developer <-> E : interview, trade-offs, challenge assumptions
== Draft ==
E -> D : write design doc
== Review ==
E -> G : design doc path only
G --> E : 1. comprehension check (explain back)
note right of G : Mismatch means the doc is ambiguous
E -> G : design doc path only (several reviewers)
G --> E : 2. antagonistic review findings
E -> D : resolve each finding (fix or reject with reason)
E -> G : design doc path only
G --> E : 3. implementation readiness: GO / NO-GO
== Approve ==
E -> Developer : result and open questions
Developer -> D : set status Approved
@enduml
